  "summary": "The paper proposes BLS-QLSTM, a hybrid model that combines broad learning system feature expansion with QLSTM gates implemented via variational quantum circuits. On CSI 300, SSEC, and CSI 500, the reported BLS-QLSTM results are RMSE/MAE/MAPE/R² of 51.64988/37.19272/0.01018/0.99570, 37.99746/27.25398/0.00926/0.99344, and 83.17634/56.26406/0.00945/0.99404, respectively, with directional accuracies of 0.72865, 0.78933, and 0.77545.",
